---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Our Free BDSM Test — Purpose, Ethics & Methodology"
  description="Learn about our client-side, anonymous BDSM test, our multi-factor scoring methodology, and our commitment to consensual, ethical self-discovery."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <Header activePath="/about" />

  <main class="flex-1 py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-16 h-80 hero-mesh"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <span class="rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-mute shadow-xs">
          About The Project
        </span>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-1.5px] text-ink">
          Clear, objective self-discovery for adult intimate dynamics.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-body leading-relaxed">
          BDSM Test is an educational self-reflection platform designed to help consenting adults (18+) understand their relationship roles, power exchange preferences, and personal boundaries with nuance and precision.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Content Cards -->
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <!-- Card 1: Our Mission -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">
            Our Purpose & Philosophy
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Intimate dynamics and consensual power exchange have often been misunderstood or reduced to rigid labels. Many existing online quizzes rely on intrusive account registrations, opaque scoring algorithms, or sensationalized assumptions.
            </p>
            <p>
              We designed this platform with three uncompromised pillars:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pt-2 text-ink">
              <li><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Absolute Privacy:</strong> All computations run locally in your browser. No questionnaire answers, scores, or identifiers are transmitted to or stored on any server.</li>
              <li><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Multidimensional Nuance:</strong> Rather than forcing users into a simplistic binary (Dominant vs. Submissive), we measure 20 distinct psychological, sensory, and role-based dimensions.</li>
              <li><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Ethical & Non-Judgmental:</strong> We celebrate healthy, consensual exploration grounded in mutual respect, clear communication, and ongoing consent.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Card 2: Assessment Methodology -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">
            Methodology & Scoring System
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Our questionnaire utilizes a standardized 5-point Likert scale (ranging from <em>Strongly Disagree</em> to <em>Strongly Agree</em>) to gauge authentic interest and comfort levels across real-world scenarios.
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface-raised p-5">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink">Quick Test (24 Questions)</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">
                  Focuses on high-signal discriminatory statements across primary axes. Ideal for users seeking a quick snapshot (~3 minutes) of their primary archetype and power balance.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface-raised p-5">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink">Comprehensive Test (64 Questions)</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">
                  In-depth evaluation covering granular edge cases, protocol structures, psychological surrender, verbal preferences, and sensation limits (~10 minutes).
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-mute">
              Scores are calculated using a weighted multi-factor scoring model that accounts for primary traits, subtle cross-correlations, and harmonic power switching dynamics.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Card 3: What to Expect -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">
            What You Can Expect From Your Results
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Upon finishing an assessment, you receive a detailed, private breakdown:
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-2 text-xs">
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface-raised p-4">
                <div class="font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Archetype Profile</div>
                <p class="text-mute">A personalized summary title reflecting your primary orientation and secondary desires.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface-raised p-4">
                <div class="font-semibold text-ink mb-1">20-Dimension Spectrum</div>
                <p class="text-mute">Color-coded percentages and tier classifications for every evaluated role.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface-raised p-4">
                <div class="font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Partner Sync Tool</div>
                <p class="text-mute">An encrypted link mechanism to compare compatibility side-by-side with a trusted partner.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Card 4: Safety & Ethical Framework -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">
            Safety, Consent & Disclaimers
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              This website is strictly intended for adults aged 18 and older. It serves as an educational self-exploration resource and does not provide psychological, psychiatric, clinical, or medical advice.
            </p>
            <p>
              We advocate for established community safety practices including <strong>Safe, Sane, and Consensual (SSC)</strong> and <strong>Risk-Aware Consensual Kink (RACK)</strong>, mandatory safewords, and dedicated aftercare.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Action CTA -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">Ready to explore your dynamics?</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-mute mt-1">Start anonymously in your browser. No registration required.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <a
              href="/test/quick"
              class="rounded-full bg-btn-primary px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-btn-primary-text hover:opacity-90 transition-all shadow-xs"
            >
              Take Quick Test
            </a>
            <a
              href="/test/comprehensive"
              class="rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-ink hover:bg-surface-raised transition-all"
            >
              Comprehensive Test
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

